[01:08.14] Intense silence
[01:11.84] As she walked in the room
[01:15.56] Her black robes trailing
[01:19.80] Sister of the moon
[01:23.42] And a black widow spider makes
[01:28.02] More sound than she
[01:31.96] And black moons in those eyes of hers
[01:35.62] Made more sense to me
[01:40.66] Heavy persuasion
[01:45.10] It was hard to breathe
[01:48.20] She was dark at the top of the stairs
[01:52.66] And she called to me
[02:14.62] And so I followed
[02:17.94] As friends often do
[02:22.02] I cared not for love, nor money
[02:26.82] I think she knew
[02:30.34] Well, the people they still love her
[02:34.56] And still they are the most cruel
[02:38.54] She asked me
[02:40.28] Be my sister, sister, sister of the moon
[02:52.76] Some call her sister of the moon
[02:54.86] Some say illusions are her game
[03:30.84] They like to wrap her in velvet
[03:36.50] Does anyone, ooo... know her name
